@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_TOKEN

# Target examples; routes are learner work and UUIDs must be replaced.

### Accept telemetry durably (replace timestamp with test fixture time)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/telemetry/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"points":[{"eventId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","deviceId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","sequence":12,"recordedAt":"2026-01-01T12:00:00Z","latitude":30.0,"longitude":31.0}]}

### Resume strictly after sequence 12
GET {{base}}/api/v1/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream
Last-Event-ID: 12

### Issue a one-use WebSocket ticket
POST {{base}}/api/v1/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/stream-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json

{}
